**/product-catalog/.trash/

# grid editorial gerado na pasta de trabalho:
#   versionar <marca>/*.json, rules/*.md, calendar/*.md, mockups/ (ativo editorial);
#   ignorar o derivado e a lixeira
**/grids/grids.html
**/grids/.trash/

